ion synchronized with respiration gate</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>1989</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>853</fpage><lpage>857</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2777676</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tada</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Hosono</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujioka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukuda</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakajima</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Inoue</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Monitoring of respiratory movement of the diaphragm for gated radiotherapy</article-title><source>Radiat Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>10</fpage><lpage>13</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15786746</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pitman</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kalff</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Every</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Risa</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Barnden</surname><given-names>LR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of mechanically simulated diaphragmatic respiratory motion on myocardial SPECT processed with and without attenuation correction</article-title><source>J Nucl Med</source><year>2002</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>1259</fpage><lpage>1267</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12215568</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B20"><label>20</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group perso